   Melo, Juliana; Pizarro, Andreia; Santos, Maria Paula, Univ Porto FADEUP, Res Ctr Phys Act Hlth \& Leisure CIAFEL, Fac Sports, Rua Dr Placido Costa 91, P-4200450 Porto, Portugal.
